{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stardream</strong> is an <strong>immersive adventure game</strong> set in a retro-futuristic universe inspired by the 60s.  <br>You play as a taxi driver on a <strong>space ark</strong>, but everything changes the day a <strong>mysterious message</strong> from outside the space station dome disrupts your routine, pushing you to uncover buried secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3ec529307da6792b51529c580c3b4c11.poster.avif?t=1770635517\" aria-label=\"Stardream reveal shoot\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3ec529307da6792b51529c580c3b4c11.webm?t=1770635517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3ec529307da6792b51529c580c3b4c11.mp4?t=1770635517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interaction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most objects in the environment are interactive. Open drawers, search furniture, examine documents, and investigate everyday items to <strong>uncover clues</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/5c917f1094fffa0a132f42645efdb4d2.poster.avif?t=1770635517\" aria-label=\"Interraction gameplay\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/5c917f1094fffa0a132f42645efdb4d2.webm?t=1770635517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/5c917f1094fffa0a132f42645efdb4d2.mp4?t=1770635517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dialogue &amp; Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you say matters. Conversations with passengers and residents influence relationships, reveal <strong>hidden truths</strong>, and <strong>branch the story</strong> in meaningful ways. <br>Once the station\u2019s secret is uncovered, prepare for tough ethical decisions. Which path will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/b959d658cdf11f63c922dd7bcd3650e5.poster.avif?t=1770635517\" aria-label=\"Dialogue choice gameplay\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/b959d658cdf11f63c922dd7bcd3650e5.webm?t=1770635517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/b959d658cdf11f63c922dd7bcd3650e5.mp4?t=1770635517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Driving &amp; Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving in <i>Stardream</i> lets you explore the station and decide the order of your <strong>investigation</strong>. Depending on where you choose to go, you trigger <strong>different choices</strong> that affect the story, unlock new leads, and shape your journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3b45c843fd4a74385e619f5d7d066515.poster.avif?t=1770635517\" aria-label=\"Driving gameplay\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3b45c843fd4a74385e619f5d7d066515.webm?t=1770635517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3b45c843fd4a74385e619f5d7d066515.mp4?t=1770635517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Exploration:</strong> Travel through diverse, richly detailed environments aboard your space taxi, visiting iconic station locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Storytelling:</strong> Make impactful decisions through rich dialogues and complex characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-Futuristic World:</strong> Dive into a unique blend of 60s design and futuristic technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysteries to Uncover:</strong> A mysterious external message sets you on a gripping quest full of secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a richly crafted world, diverse gameplay, and a gripping story where every choice shapes your fate.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3654740?t=1770635517","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/23e435711a1747bf7569ef6d35385990cf15f666/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770635517","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/88115d879e1997eb33359540feb9eb55b5667944/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770635517","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/88115d879e1997eb33359540feb9eb55b5667944/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770635517","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stardream</strong> is an <strong>immersive adventure game</strong> set in a retro-futuristic universe inspired by the 60s.  <br>You play as a taxi driver on a <strong>space ark</strong>, but everything changes the day a <strong>mysterious message</strong> from outside the space station dome disrupts your routine, pushing you to uncover buried secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3ec529307da6792b51529c580c3b4c11.poster.avif?t=1770635517\" aria-label=\"Stardream reveal shoot\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3ec529307da6792b51529c580c3b4c11.webm?t=1770635517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3ec529307da6792b51529c580c3b4c11.mp4?t=1770635517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interaction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most objects in the environment are interactive. Open drawers, search furniture, examine documents, and investigate everyday items to <strong>uncover clues</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/5c917f1094fffa0a132f42645efdb4d2.poster.avif?t=1770635517\" aria-label=\"Interraction gameplay\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/5c917f1094fffa0a132f42645efdb4d2.webm?t=1770635517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/5c917f1094fffa0a132f42645efdb4d2.mp4?t=1770635517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dialogue &amp; Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you say matters. Conversations with passengers and residents influence relationships, reveal <strong>hidden truths</strong>, and <strong>branch the story</strong> in meaningful ways. <br>Once the station\u2019s secret is uncovered, prepare for tough ethical decisions. Which path will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/b959d658cdf11f63c922dd7bcd3650e5.poster.avif?t=1770635517\" aria-label=\"Dialogue choice gameplay\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/b959d658cdf11f63c922dd7bcd3650e5.webm?t=1770635517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/b959d658cdf11f63c922dd7bcd3650e5.mp4?t=1770635517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Driving &amp; Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving in <i>Stardream</i> lets you explore the station and decide the order of your <strong>investigation</strong>. Depending on where you choose to go, you trigger <strong>different choices</strong> that affect the story, unlock new leads, and shape your journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3b45c843fd4a74385e619f5d7d066515.poster.avif?t=1770635517\" aria-label=\"Driving gameplay\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3b45c843fd4a74385e619f5d7d066515.webm?t=1770635517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/extras/3b45c843fd4a74385e619f5d7d066515.mp4?t=1770635517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Exploration:</strong> Travel through diverse, richly detailed environments aboard your space taxi, visiting iconic station locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Storytelling:</strong> Make impactful decisions through rich dialogues and complex characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-Futuristic World:</strong> Dive into a unique blend of 60s design and futuristic technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysteries to Uncover:</strong> A mysterious external message sets you on a gripping quest full of secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a richly crafted world, diverse gameplay, and a gripping story where every choice shapes your fate.</p>","developers":["Rebel Pixel"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654740/9c3b362b54992f7ba4586096fac05ce2d3243099/header.jpg?t=1770635517","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3654740/1488956763/cac9226d81d0303ac022e4184da6be941efac973/1750415593/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768472461","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3654740/1488956763/cac9226d81d0303ac022e4184da6be941efac973/1750415593/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768472461","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3654740/1488956763/cac9226d81d0303ac022e4184da6be941efac973/1750415